────────────────────────────────────────
DEFINITION OF DONE
────────────────────────────────────────

Any change must:
- Compile successfully (npm run build)
- Respect TypeScript types
- Not introduce new architectural patterns
- Keep security, tenant isolation, and performance intact
- Include server-side authorization checks
- Include Zod validation for inputs
- Include audit log entries for sensitive actions when applicable

Implementation rules:
- Propose a plan before large changes.
- Modify only necessary files.
- Avoid speculative or unused code.
- Keep code production-grade (no placeholders or TODOs that change behavior).
